options.tooltip:
A [php-csvmap](https://github.com/keboola/php-csvmap) definition. Use `"source.path": "column"` for a plain column, and an object with `"type": "table"` to break a nested structure out into a child table:

```json
{
  "title": "title",
  "info.rating": "rating",
  "info": {
    "type": "table",
    "destination": "info",
    "tableMapping": { "rating": "rating" }
  }
}
```

A path that resolves to an object or array without a table mapping fails the job.
